UnitCLGauge::Earned
└── when calculating selected positions
    ├── when no positions are requested
    │   ├── when the account has no deferred LP emissions
    │   │   └── it should return zero
    │   └── when the account has deferred LP emissions
    │       └── it should return the full deferred balance
    ├── when calculating one position
    │   ├── when the token id is not staked by the account
    │   │   └── it should revert with NA
    │   └── when the position is staked by the account
    │       ├── when the position has no accrued emissions
    │       │   └── it should return zero
    │       ├── when the position has accrued emissions
    │       │   ├── when there is no penalty and no referral
    │       │   │   ├── when the reward growth is known
    │       │   │   │   ├── it should return full emissions
    │       │   │   │   └── it should align claimed emissions with earned
    │       │   │   └── when the reward growth varies
    │       │   │       ├── it should return full emissions
    │       │   │       └── it should align claimed emissions with earned
    │       │   ├── when there is a penalty rate
    │       │   │   ├── when called within min stake blocks
    │       │   │   │   └── it should return emissions after penalty
    │       │   │   └── when called after min stake blocks
    │       │   │       └── it should return full emissions
    │       │   ├── when there is a referral share
    │       │   │   └── it should return emissions after referral
    │       │   └── when there is a penalty rate and a referral share
    │       │       ├── when the voter has no new cumulative reward share
    │       │       │   ├── it should apply the penalty before the referral
    │       │       │   └── it should return emissions after penalty and referral
    │       │       └── when the voter has a new cumulative reward share
    │       │           ├── it should include the projected reward share
    │       │           ├── it should apply the penalty before the referral
    │       │           └── it should return emissions after penalty and referral
    │       ├── when the voter projects a lower cumulative reward share
    │       │   └── it should ignore the regressed projection
    │       └── when the pool has no staked liquidity
    │           └── it should return settled emissions without projecting the reward share
    ├── when calculating multiple selected positions
    │   └── it should return selected and deferred LP emissions
    └── when calculating all staked positions
        ├── when the account has no staked positions or deferred emissions
        │   └── it should return zero
        └── when the account has multiple staked positions
            ├── it should return live and deferred LP emissions
            └── it should apply the early withdrawal penalty only to live emissions
